        "target_id": "TEST-f1b692f59ec2f3530f895873",
        "blocking": true,
        "finding": "The title obligation says the title data-figma-id=\"4953:6611\" \"contains exactly \\\"Zones corporelles\\\"\". Both enforcing gates are strictly stronger than \"contains\": the independent observer returns `title.textContent` and verifyMeasurements compares non-numeric EQUALS values by exact canonical equality (tolerance is never applied to strings), while the markup gate requires the literal adjacency `data-figma-id=\"4953:6611\"[^>]*>Zones corporelles</`. A pretty-printed title (`>\\n  Zones corporelles\\n</h1>`) or any nested inline element inside the title satisfies the ordinary reading of \"contains exactly\" and would be written by a reasonable implementer, yet fails both VNEXT_FIGMA_TARGET_NOT_SATISFIED and VNEXT_FIGMA_REAL_EXACT_TITLE_REQUIRED. The obligation does not state the required DOM shape it is actually measured against.",
        "evidence": [
          "AST-a104517bbca5a679de5bbb84 expected: {\"kind\":\"EQUALS\",\"tolerance\":0,\"unit\":\"TEXT\",\"value\":\"Zones corporelles\",\"viewports\":[402]}",
          "figma observation manifest (figma/observation.json:86-104) — FIGPROP-14eff1f237c41d5b6e0ba677 observed value is the bare string \"Zones corporelles\"",
          "scripts/kodjo/lib/vnext-figma-browser-observer.js:121-127 — observer resolves the title node by data-figma-id and returns `title:title.textContent` verbatim, with no trim and no normalisation",
          "scripts/kodjo/lib/vnext-figma-source.js:256-259 — verifyMeasurements: the numeric/tolerance branch applies only when both rule value and measured value are numbers; the TEXT case falls through to `eq(m.value,d.rule.value,'VNEXT_FIGMA_TARGET_NOT_SATISFIED')`, i.e. exact canonical equality",
          "scripts/kodjo/qualify-vnext-figma-real-path.js:116 — `if(!/\\bdata-figma-id\\s*=\\s*([\"'])4953:6611\\1[^>]*>Zones corporelles<\\//.test(html))throw Error('VNEXT_FIGMA_REAL_EXACT_TITLE_REQUIRED');`"
        ],
        "required_correction": "Reword the title clause in TEST-f1b692f59ec2f3530f895873 and in the identically worded TEST-6fd8a43c2b71b836def3e99a (and the corresponding implementation constraint) to require that the element bearing data-figma-id=\"4953:6611\" has exactly one text child whose value is strictly equal to \"Zones corporelles\" — no leading or trailing whitespace, no nested elements — and state explicitly that substring, trimmed or whitespace-normalised comparisons are insufficient.",
        "dependency_target_ids": [
          "AST-a104517bbca5a679de5bbb84",
